cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EDCOCR: Forensic-Grade OCR Platform for Electronic Discovery and Document Processing"
message: "If you use this software in research, citation, or evidentiary work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "EDCOCR Contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/mattmre/EDCOCR-PUBLIC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mattmre/EDCOCR-PUBLIC"
url: "https://github.com/mattmre/EDCOCR-PUBLIC"
abstract: >-
  EDCOCR provides OCR, searchable document output, custody records, standalone
  API access and a separate distributed worker coordinator. This release
  candidate targets single-host API operation and bounded local worker-farm
  replay. Infrastructure-specific qualification remains operator-owned.
keywords:
  - "optical character recognition"
  - "ocr"
  - "electronic discovery"
  - "ediscovery"
  - "forensic computing"
  - "document processing"
  - "chain of custody"
  - "paddleocr"
  - "distributed systems"
  - "legal technology"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 4.2.0-rc.1
date-released: 2026-10-08
